1. Create a measure to calculate total sales revenue using Quantity and UnitPrice.
2. Calculate the average salary of all employees.
3. Calculate total sales for Delivered orders only.
4. Calculate the percentage contribution of each product to total revenue.
5. Rank employees by salary, with the highest salary ranked first.


Total Revenue = SUMX(Sales, Sales[Quantity] * Sales[UnitPrice])

Average Salary = AVERAGE(Employees[Salary])

Delivered Sales = CALCULATE(SUM(Orders[Amount]), Orders[Status] = "Delivered")

Revenue Contribution % = DIVIDE([Total Revenue], CALCULATE([Total Revenue], ALL(Sales[ProductID])))

Employee Rank = RANKX(ALL(Employees[EmployeeID]), CALCULATE(SUM(Employees[Salary])),, DESC, DENSE)
